{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1180472-which-members-do-the-kami-have","id":1180472,"title":"Which members do the Kami have?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-01-29T12:45:45-08:00","id":1180472,"title":"Which members do the Kami have?","content":"I just made a similar topic for the Manitou, and while they're much easier to research, I'm curious who was selected to be a core member of the Kami. I'd particularly like to know whether Raijin and Fujin were gods or Titans.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13079-wannabe-demon-lord","name":"Wannabe Demon Lord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-29T12:49:54-08:00","id":1180474,"title":"","content":"Neither are listed with the Kami in the pdf we have. We don't have confirmation as to whether they're Titans or not.<br /> <br /> For other details, none of the potential Japanese Buddhist figures like Jizo or Marishiten are present. Izanagi and Izanami aren't there either. Each of the 7 Lucky Gods, however, does have an individual entry. Tenjin and Ryujin are the most notable omissions, and IMO are the most likely for the Companion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12989,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12989-center-of-all","user":"Center-of-All","date":". 01-29-2018, 03:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12989-center-of-all","name":"Center-of-All","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-29T12:53:00-08:00","id":1180478,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wannabe Demon Lord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1180472-which-members-do-the-kami-have#post1180472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just made a similar topic for the Manitou, and while they're much easier to research, I'm curious who was selected to be a core member of the Kami.</div> </div> </div> </div>The lineup is:<br /> <br /> Amaterasu, Amatsukami of the Sun and Ruler of Heaven<br /> <br /> Tsukiyomi, Amatsukami of the Moon<br /> <br /> Susano-Wo, Amatsukami of the Sea, Death, and Storms<br /> <br /> Hachiman, Amatsukami of Warriors, Archery, and Culture<br /> <br /> Inari, Kunitsukami of Rice, Fertility, Foxes<br /> <br /> Ama-no-Izume, Amatsukami of Dawn, Revelry, and Mirth, and wife of Sarutahiko<br /> <br /> Sarutahiko, Kunitsukami of Martial Arts, Monkeys, King of the Earthly Kami, and husband of Ama-no-Izume<br /> <br /> Takemikazuchi, Amatsukami of Thunder, Swords, and Sumo<br /> <br /> Ebisu, Fortune of Luck and Fishing<br /> <br /> Okuninushi, former Kunitsukami and Fortune of Heroes, Magic, and Wealth, and Lord of Izumo, the Fortress Guarding the Underworld<br /> <br /> Bishamon, Fortune of War, Warriors, and Punisher of Evildoers<br /> <br /> Benten, Fortune of Talent and Eloquence<br /> <br /> Fukurokuju, Fortune of Longevity and Wisdom<br /> <br /> Kisshoten, Fortune of Beauty and Mercy<br /> <br /> Hotei, Fortune of Joy, Contentment, and Guardian of Children<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-29T14:05:36-08:00","id":1180500,"title":"","content":"Not the lineup I would have expected. Interesting though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13079-wannabe-demon-lord","name":"Wannabe Demon Lord","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-29T14:26:16-08:00","id":1180504,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1180472-which-members-do-the-kami-have?p=1180478#post1180478\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The lineup is:<br /> <br /> Amaterasu, Amatsukami of the Sun and Ruler of Heaven<br /> <br /> Tsukiyomi, Amatsukami of the Moon<br /> <br /> Susano-Wo, Amatsukami of the Sea, Death, and Storms<br /> <br /> Hachiman, Amatsukami of Warriors, Archery, and Culture<br /> <br /> Inari, Kunitsukami of Rice, Fertility, Foxes<br /> <br /> Ama-no-Izume, Amatsukami of Dawn, Revelry, and Mirth, and wife of Sarutahiko<br /> <br /> Sarutahiko, Kunitsukami of Martial Arts, Monkeys, King of the Earthly Kami, and husband of Ama-no-Izume<br /> <br /> Takemikazuchi, Amatsukami of Thunder, Swords, and Sumo<br /> <br /> Ebisu, Fortune of Luck and Fishing<br /> <br /> Okuninushi, former Kunitsukami and Fortune of Heroes, Magic, and Wealth, and Lord of Izumo, the Fortress Guarding the Underworld<br /> <br /> Bishamon, Fortune of War, Warriors, and Punisher of Evildoers<br /> <br /> Benten, Fortune of Talent and Eloquence<br /> <br /> Fukurokuju, Fortune of Longevity and Wisdom<br /> <br /> Kisshoten, Fortune of Beauty and Mercy<br /> <br /> Hotei, Fortune of Joy, Contentment, and Guardian of Children</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you Marin","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-29T16:37:17-08:00","id":1180538,"title":"","content":"I guess Daikoku isn't around since he's being treated as a Mantle of Shiva? Though I find it a little weird that he's not included but Benten and Kisshoten who are also arguably Mantles of Deva are included.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1344-samudra","name":"Samudra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1344_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"497"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-29T16:44:16-08:00","id":1180542,"title":"","content":"Daikoku is Okuninushi.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12989-center-of-all","name":"Center-of-All","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-29T23:27:39-08:00","id":1180623,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Center-of-All</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1180472-which-members-do-the-kami-have?p=1180542#post1180542\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Daikoku is Okuninushi.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I wish they'd made the Daikoku Mantle primary, and had Okuninushi as who he was before being overthrown by Ninigi, and then adopting Buddhism.<br /> <br /> That said, focusing the Okuninushi myths was an elegant way not to avoid what would have likely be some heavy redundancy with other Lucky Gods otherwise! Just as using Kisshoten instead of Jurojin avoids Jurojin's huge overlap with Fukurokuju.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 01-30-2018, 02:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-29T23:29:21-08:00","id":1180624,"title":"","content":"Anyone taking bets on Oyamatsumi and Konahanasakuya-hime for the Companion?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-29T23:39:10-08:00","id":1180630,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wannabe Demon Lord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1180472-which-members-do-the-kami-have#post1180472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just made a similar topic for the Manitou, and while they're much easier to research, I'm curious who was selected to be a core member of the Kami. I'd particularly like to know whether Raijin and Fujin were gods or Titans.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> My guess right now on Raijin and Fujin is that that whatever their origins, they're at the Demigod Legend range. They show up blowing around and making lightning and thunder in individual storms, but they're not on Susano-o's power level over storms in the abstract.<br /> <br /> <br /> I cannot express how happy I am that Inari is a core god this time! Given that s/he's the most widely worshiped god in the Japan, and has been since the Edo period, s/he deserved to be on the top-billing list! (I think I recall asking Neall and him answering that Inari shifts between male and female preferred pronouns depending on his or her form, unlike Loki who remains &quot;they/them&quot; in English regardless of their form).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 01-30-2018, 02:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T08:31:20-08:00","id":1180727,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1180472-which-members-do-the-kami-have?p=1180624#post1180624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyone taking bets on Oyamatsumi and Konahanasakuya-hime for the Companion?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Eh, I think it'll be more likely that we get Ryujin and Tenjin before either of those.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12989-center-of-all","name":"Center-of-All","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T10:13:45-08:00","id":1180786,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Center-of-All</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1180472-which-members-do-the-kami-have?p=1180727#post1180727\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Eh, I think it'll be more likely that we get Ryujin and Tenjin before either of those.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Remains to be seen whether Ryujin and Ao Guang are actually the same relatively non-hostile (unless you fuck with his shit... NEZHA!) Sea Titan.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-30T12:10:56-08:00","id":1180839,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1180472-which-members-do-the-kami-have?p=1180478#post1180478\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Takemikazuchi, Amatsukami of Thunder, Swords, and Sumo</div> </div> </div> </div>And I will play his son, who aspires to be the God of Strong-Style.<br /> <br /> I like this list. My main quibble with the original Kami line up from 1st ed was that it seemed kind of small compared to some of the others. I can see a lot of potential character concepts and ideas here, especially for something like an all-Kami Scion chronicle done in a manga/anime influenced style.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T00:09:14-08:00","id":1183850,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1180472-which-members-do-the-kami-have?p=1180624#post1180624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyone taking bets on Oyamatsumi and Konahanasakuya-hime for the Companion?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm hoping Izanagi as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1268-cosmic-mind","name":"Cosmic Mind","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1268_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T00:30:17-08:00","id":1183851,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cosmic Mind</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1180472-which-members-do-the-kami-have?p=1183850#post1183850\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm hoping Izanagi as well.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I'm guessing he's a Primordial this time around (Izanami under this theory would be a Primordial who has fallen to become a Titan in her death).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-09T01:11:20-08:00","id":1183855,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1180472-which-members-do-the-kami-have?p=1183851#post1183851\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm guessing he's a Primordial this time around (Izanami under this theory would be a Primordial who has fallen to become a Titan in her death).</div> </div> </div> </div>Per Neall, Izanami's a Primordial (note Origin mentions Underworld Primordials).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}